**/*.cache.npz
Sensors.csv

# --- Secrets & local env (never commit real values) ---
.env
*.env
!*.env.example

# --- Claude Code per-user local settings (machine-specific, not shared) ---
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Editor / OS / tooling noise ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.playwright-mcp/

# --- Launcher's dedicated browser profile (if ever created here) ---
MeltioViewer/

